LuPerry.com

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:03.730
Let's do our best today.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.050
What is it?

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:41.210
The Maid Has Come!

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.350
She's so pretty.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:47.180
It's not the time to be impressed, we are in trouble too, sis.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.440
She hasn't eaten anything in the past few days.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.360
Thanks for the food.

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:56.570
Thank you.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.920
I will never forget this.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.530
Anyone would help a person in need.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:05.420
On the other hand, if you don't mind, would you like to tell us what happened?

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:07.800
We might be able to help you.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.380
Thank you so much.

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:13.170
My name is Ayatsuji Kinu.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:14.930
I'm 18 years old.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:20.900
To pay back my runaway parents' debt, I'm working as a maid in a rich family's house.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:24.790
But I was the subject of abuse by our lady.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:26.830
At the end...

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:31.190
I was falsely accused of breaking master's priced vase.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.010
You are fired!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.590
I had no where to go, no one to depend on, and no money.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.480
I was wandering aimlessly the whole week.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.120
It's just like in the movies.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.220
It must have been difficult.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.510
I thought our poverty was bad.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.650
There is always someone more unfortunate in this world.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:51.880
I know how you feel, I was abused by my siblings too.

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.170
Right, Byako?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:58.170
Koushi-dono, can we let her stay over at our place?

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.740
I feel really sorry for her.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:03.030
But she is a girl.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.910
There are those private situations...

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.080
Ah, I know.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.210
The attic is empty.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:11.290
What do you think?

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.270
The person lived here before left all her belongings.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.710
Use them all you want.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:20.270
The landlord said this room is for storage, so there is no rent.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:24.410
I was living in the attic before too.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:26.510
So I'm quite used to it, and I feel more comfortable here.

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:27.900
So it's decided.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.720
This is great, Kinu-dono.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:30.720
Yes.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.140
Thank you very much, everyone.

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:37.570
Allow me to help.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.060
You can leave the rest to me.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.240
I want to return the favor.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:49.680
She's so modest.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.540
I heard it's going to rain tomorrow.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:54.390
Do something about the leak on the roof.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:55.020
Okay.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.870
Leave this to me.

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:02.180
You are very skilled.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.470
You really helped us.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:05.540
This is nothing.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.360
Oh, sis, it's about time.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:11.690
Oh, the tennis club asked me to help.

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:12.510
Leave it to me.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.270
I play tennis too.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:17.690
Ultimate technique, rikazugi play!

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.070
What!?

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:20.390
Kinu senpai!

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.810
Try to return this!

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:26.540
Game set to Fuuunji!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:29.240
Kinu senpai, you did great.

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:30.880
So did you.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:32.730
She's so beautiful.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:34.390
She's amazing.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.160
Shit, I won't make the delivery in time.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:41.300
I'll be fired if I'm late.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:42.870
Now we can't pay the rent.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:43.900
It's alright.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.820
I'll help you.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.330
Let's go.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.840
Eh? Wait...

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:54.360
No one can drive faster than me!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.760
I made it somehow...

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:00.480
You are a lifesaver, Kinu-san.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.600
You even helped me on grocery shopping.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.610
I'm feeling a little guilty about this somehow.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:12.540
I am the one who should hope it wasn't a bother to budge in.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:14.740
Not at all, you really helped.

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:16.180
Thank god.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.440
By the way, Momoko-san.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:19.320
What is it?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:27.860
Kinu...

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.080
...dono...

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.100
Enjoy the meal.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:34.800
This is amazing!

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.520
Itadakimasu!

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:37.810
This is great.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.130
It's delicious!

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:40.390
This taste...

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.080
It reminds me of my mother's cooking.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:44.030
There is more if you want.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.730
By the way, Momoko senpai sure is late.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:48.420
About that...

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:52.690
On our way back, she handed me all the groceries and left.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.890
She's so hopeless.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:56.810
She'll be back soon.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:06:58.630
Momoko.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.230
What's wrong, why are you holding your stomach?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.860
Are you that hungry?

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.520
No one is using the toilet.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:04.470
Shut up!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.000
I'm sorry!

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:06.600
Come sit over here.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.830
I have prepared your share.

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:10.680
You'll be late for the cleanup.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:11.560
Hurry up and eat.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:13.480
Yes.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.460
But why is it so delicious?

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.730
Oh Hanzo, you are all sweet talks.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.810
Could you teach me how to cook next time?

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.410
Sure, Iroha-chan.

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:28.860
Let's do it on the next holiday.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.370
She punched you?

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:32.440
Yes.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.360
All of a sudden, on our way back.

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.580
She doesn't look like the kind of person who would use violence.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.560
I don't believe it either.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.070
But it's the fact.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.740
Please believe me.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.660
I have a bad feeling about it.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.140
Allow me to join you tonight.

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:52.570
Koushi-dono...

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:57.560
That was a good sleep.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.540
What's this?

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:05.810
Please forgive me for not bidding you farewell.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.040
It's all my fault.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:10.810
It's because I took Momoko-san's job.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:15.580
She never talked to me after dinner because she was angry at me.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.250
I don't want to anger Momoko-san anymore.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:21.730
I'm leaving.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:24.240
I will never forget what everyone has done for me.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:25.880
Farewell.

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:27.260
Kinu-san...

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.420
Excuse me.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.370
Good morning Koushi-dono.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.350
I have prepared breakfast.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:34.260
I don't need it.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:34.920
Huh?

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:37.520
Koushi-dono?

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:48.010
Hey, what's wrong with Inuzuka-kun?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:51.530
Hey Hanzo, that's mine.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.250
Come on, finders keepers.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:54.510
I was ignored.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:57.840
He's not eating the lunch I made.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:00.510
I wonder how Kinu senpai is doing.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:01.760
Kinu senpai?

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:05.150
She is a helpful and beautiful maid, isn't she?

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.750
A maid came over?

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:07.820
Yeah.

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:09.960
Why did she leave all of a sudden?

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.180
Someone explain it to me...

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:10.800
I don't know.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:13.250
Koushi-dono...

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.050
See you tomorrow, Inuzuka-kun.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:17.210
See you tomorrow.

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:21.160
Stop it!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:25.250
Lady, I don't want to do this either.

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.980
So just give me whatever you have.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.550
A while longer...

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.870
Can you wait just a while longer?

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:33.660
Do you want to get hurt?

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:34.290
Stop it!

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:35.200
Huh?

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:40.820
What you are doing is against the guidelines set out by the financial services agency.

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:42.290
What did you say?

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:48.160
You won't leave here in one piece if you ever touch that woman.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.830
Get lost!

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.270
I'll kill you.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.160
N-N-N-No violence!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.180
Kinu-san, are you hurt?

00:09:58.560 --> 00:09:59.180
No.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.890
You saved me twice, I don't know what to say to thank you...

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:04.900
You don't need to thank us.

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:10.490
But I think it's safer for you to stay in our apartment, since you have that debt on you.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.430
Senpai is right.

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:14.910
We can chase away those scumbags any time.

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:16.920
Thank you so much.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:17.800
But...

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.440
You too, protect Kinu-san.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.300
Do me a favor.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:25.750
OK...

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:46.470
I... I think that's enough...

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:47.820
This won't do.

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:50.920
I can't chop off someone's head with this.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:52.900
What did you just say?

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:55.260
I'm going to kill Inuzuka Koushi.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.620
I'm an assassin, you see.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:00.280
I won't let you!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:03.920
What's wrong!?

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:07.250
This is...

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:10.260
The cooking I made for Koushi-sama with all my effort...

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:11.900
Momoko-san...

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.220
Momoko-san...

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:13.910
You!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.320
Tha... That's not true!

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:17.140
This person is actually an assassin.

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:18.460
An assassin?

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.630
She said she's going to kill Koushi-dono with a kitchen knife.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.040
I never said such a thing!

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.380
Please forgive her.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:31.490
She's just jealous that you are better at housework than she is.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:32.900
Jealous...?

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.160
I...

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:35.790
Saying that Kinu-san punched you.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:36.890
Saying that she is an assassin.

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.520
If this is not jealousy, then what is?

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:42.380
I was just telling you the truth!

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.930
Let's go out for some fresh air.

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:45.930
Okay.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.070
Koushi-dono!

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:01.380
That person is an assassin!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.540
I'm telling the truth, please believe me!

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.100
Kinu-san is not an assassin.

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:09.130
<i>Onii-chan~</i>

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:09.980
<i>Let's play~</i>

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:11.740
When I was playing games...

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:14.160
<i>Hanzo-kun likes that game?</i>

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:15.030
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:21.880
Note: Think of "moe" as a quality between "cute" and "hot" that is used to describe anime characters.

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:21.880
A person who can draw something as moe as this can never be an assassin!

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:24.140
Onii-chan~

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.910
Don't confuse senpai with your bias.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:29.350
But senpai...

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:31.990
I don't think Kinu senpai is an assassin either.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:33.460
Why?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.280
When we were playing tennis.

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:38.580
Her muscles don't look like that of a martial artist.

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:40.940
She is clearly a normal person.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:41.970
I'm sorry.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.330
Momoko, neither do I think Kinu-san is an assassin.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:46.680
Tenka-dono...

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:48.470
I think you should've noticed it too.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.570
She doesn't have any battle aura.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:54.000
No matter how weak a martial artist is, she has to have battle aura.

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:57.170
But I can't feel it from Kinu-san.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.020
You are right.

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:01.310
Maybe I made a mistake due to my inexperience.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:02.570
Momoko...

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:05.710
I'm sorry I made you guys worry.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.620
Even if no one believes me...

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:23.290
For Koushi-dono's safety, I won't lose to an assassin.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.460
I remade everything.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.280
Enjoy, everyone.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:29.690
Itadakimasu.

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:32.960
What are you doing?

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.530
I have to test for poison just in case.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:35.690
That's unnecessary!

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:37.730
If you eat like that, poison...

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:39.900
Très bien.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:42.410
Thank you, monsieur.

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:45.420
Let me know if there is anything you want to eat.

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.370
I'll make it with all my heart.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:48.880
I'm so glad.

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:50.070
I won't lose...

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.160
I won't lose...

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:07.710
It feels like Momoko-san is always watching me.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.380
Just ignore her.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.360
I won't lose...

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.240
Good night, senpai.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:14.430
Good night.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:15.150
Good night.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.450
Good night, Momoko-san.

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:18.670
Good night.

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:20.710
I'll kill Inuzuka Koushi tonight.

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:21.970
What's wrong?

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:23.910
It's nothing.

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:25.740
Kinu-san is a nice person, isn't she?

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:26.110
Huh?

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:28.120
Try to get along with her.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:32.360
Koushi-dono...

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.870
I'm sorry.

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.250
I...

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:39.050
Yes.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.370
Excuse me.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.340
Is there anything you want?

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:48.810
I have something to talk to you about.

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.130
I see.

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:51.510
Good timing.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.120
Let's go somewhere else.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:14:59.230
So?

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:00.490
What do you want to talk about?

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:02.910
You are playing dirty.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.540
I'm sorry.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.010
Huh?

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:06.610
But there is no other way.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:09.120
It's for Tenten-sama's sake.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:10.760
Tenten...

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.830
Don't tell me... One of the Koganei siblings?

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:13.800
That's right.

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:17.380
If you are a martial artist, then fight me fair and square!

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:18.860
I'm not a martial artist.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.430
I'm a normal person.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.160
It's just that I have a special power.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.510
A special power?

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:29.250
I can master certain skills just by cosplaying.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.160
That can't...

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.550
A carpenter or a racer.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.090
Or a housewife.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.730
I can be a pro as long as I have the right cloth.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:42.780
And to use my special power in combat...

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:47.680
Battle gear cosplay!

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:49.910
Battle gear cosplay?

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:51.950
Kuzuryuu Momoko, prepare yourself!

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:56.500
Now it's my turn!

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.660
You are pretty good.

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:13.270
You don't have to hold back.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:15.530
Kinu-san...

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.380
Translation: "Koushi-sama, Momoko asked me to come out, I'm going to the open space in the back."

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.230
Hey, you.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.330
Do you have any dress-up dolls?

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:28.400
What are you talking about, all of a sudden?

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:32.610
I'm Tenten-sama's favorite dress-up doll.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.650
She lets me wear a lot of cloths.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.230
From a nurse to a police woman...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.890
She even dressed me up as a sumo wrestler.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:46.830
When she changes me, I can feel Tenten-sama's slender fingers rub against my body.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:49.400
They are cold, it felt like they are about to rupture through my skin.

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:51.130
I can't contain myself anymore...

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.550
Wha... What's that has to do with anything?

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:54.960
Don't you understand?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.340
It's love.

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:59.040
Tenten-sama and I are in love.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:03.000
There is no love in an engagement like yours.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.100
That's...

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:09.530
But you guys are breaking apart after my little fiddling.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:13.480
You are empty, you are completely empty.

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.770
That's not true!

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:22.270
Kinu-san!

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:23.180
Koushi-dono!

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:26.320
Kinu-san!

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.200
Koushi-dono!

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:28.840
Are you alright?

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.820
Momoko-san... suddenly attacked me.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.170
That's not true!

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:33.890
You...

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:35.900
You are going that far just to make Kinu-san leave?

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:36.750
That's not it!

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.820
Please listen to me!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:39.640
Shut up!

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.960
I don't want to see your face anymore!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.590
Don't ever come back again!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.420
Kinu-san, here.

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:47.640
Thank you.

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:51.690
I...

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:54.450
I did it for Koushi-dono...

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:57.470
...for Koushi-dono's sake...

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.350
You made Momoko leave!?

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:08.740
I don't care what the reason is, I won't forgive you!

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:09.340
Stop it.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.070
I'll go look for Momoko.

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:15.550
Sis.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:18.060
Let's go look for Momoko-chan too.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:18.750
Yeah.

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:49.490
What are you doing over there?

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:53.480
Who's there?

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.830
Nice to meet you, Koushi-kun.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.370
I'm Tenka's big brother.

00:18:58.910 --> 00:18:59.880
The Koganei siblings...

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:02.990
Fierce battle aura...

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:03.930
This can't be...

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.360
That person...

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:11.060
He's strong...

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:14.110
Shindara Rettetsu style, Koganei Tenrei.

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:15.520
This is my big sister...

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.560
Ah. There is my dress-up doll.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:18.850
Tenten-sama...

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:21.010
They are friends?

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.270
So what she said is true.

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:27.260
I did my best for Tenten-sama's sake.

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:28.550
Please compliment me.

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:31.780
And please put on new dresses on me with your hands.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.360
You are right, I should reward you.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:35.860
You shouldn't, sister.

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:36.960
Remind her of her status.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.630
You are too stingy.

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:40.070
That's meaningless.

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:43.150
Because he is about to die.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:47.860
I am Kuzuryuu Momoko of the Haira Ichiden style.

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:51.880
I can see you are a reputable martial artist from the Koganei clan.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.320
Your... Your name is?

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:55.890
Hand over Inuzuka Koushi.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:56.620
Eh?

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.480
So he doesn't even care to state his name.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.520
An arrogant martial artist...

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:04.400
So you are here to hurt Koushi-dono.

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:05.500
I won't let you!

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:07.700
I will face you with my full strength!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:11.150
Black dragon morning destroyer!

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.110
You are weak.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.810
He didn't even flinch...

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:31.310
Koganei Tenga.

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:34.980
But it's done.

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:35.830
What?

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:38.030
He's probably already...

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:39.970
Koushi-dono...!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.960
Tenten-sama, dress me...

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:45.940
Play with me...

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:48.010
She was their friend...

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:48.950
This is terrible...

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:51.090
I threw that away already.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.350
I got tired of playing with dolls.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:54.670
Sister.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:56.770
Stop playing and get it over with already.

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:58.370
I'm getting to it.

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:00.290
More bombs?

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:01.980
Koushi-dono...

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:03.490
Bye bye.

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:04.740
Koushi-dono!

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:08.010
Koushi-dono!

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:12.310
Koushi-dono!

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:15.360
Koushi-dono!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.710
It's not exploding.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:18.120
You are sick.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.730
Just killing him won't be any fun at all.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:22.700
Stop admitting your enjoyment.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:24.400
Hang in there!

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:26.350
Koushi-dono.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.390
Hang in there!

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.580
What did you make him eat!?

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:35.360
Note: the literal translation is "the poison of a chin's feather", and a chin is a legendary bird of Chinese origin, which is extremely poisonous.

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.250
Chinu no putomain.

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:35.360
"Chinu no putomain"?

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:42.010
Inuzuka Koushi, the poison will spread through your body until you die...

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:44.900
...after a week.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:48.950
You have one more week to live.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
May tonight be...

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
今夜もしかして

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
konya moshikashite

00:21:56.380 --> 00:22:00.690
Le... Le... Le... Le... Le... Let's fight!

00:21:56.380 --> 00:22:00.690
ガッガッガッガガガチで勝負する

00:21:56.380 --> 00:22:00.690
gaggaggaggaga gachide shoubu suru

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.710
It's a fight between maidens.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.710
乙女の闘い

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.710
otome no tatakai

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:09.480
It's where love leads to.

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:09.480
恋の行く末はいざいざ

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:09.480
koi no yukusue wa izaiza

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:13.630
Wearing an apron.

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:13.630
エプロン姿で

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:13.630
epuron sugata de

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:16.850
Feeling like honey.

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:16.850
ハチミツ気分

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:16.850
hachimitsu kibun

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:20.120
Place down three of my fingers.

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:20.120
三つ指ついて

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:20.120
mitsu yubi tsuite

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:23.830
And say "Welcome home."

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:23.830
おかえりなさいませ

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:23.830
okaerinasaimase

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:26.650
Even if I was treated unfairly.

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:26.650
むちゃむちゃされても

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:26.650
muchamucha saretemo

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:29.850
Even if I was punished.

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:29.850
おしおきされても

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:29.850
oshioki saretemo

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:33.110
I will follow you bare footed.

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:33.110
裸足でついてく

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:33.110
hadashi de tsuiteku

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:36.870
Side steps to the left and to the right.

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:36.870
反復横とび　左へ　右へ

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:36.870
hanfukuyokotobi　hidari e　migi e

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:39.890
Deeper than the sea.

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:39.890
海より深くて

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:39.890
umi yori fukakute

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:43.020
Higher than the sky.

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:43.020
空より高いの

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:43.020
sora yori takai no

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:48.020
The burst of imaginations is too painful.

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:48.020
はじける妄想切なすぎ

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:48.020
hajikeru mousou setsunasugi

00:22:48.110 --> 00:22:50.770
I will devote my everything.

00:22:48.110 --> 00:22:50.770
しみじみ　しちゃうよ

00:22:48.110 --> 00:22:50.770
shimijimi　shichauyo

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:54.590
They are turning pink.

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:54.590
薄紅色した

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:54.590
usubeniiro shita

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:57.650
The end of being maidens.

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:57.650
乙女の儚い

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:57.650
otome no hakanai

00:22:58.050 --> 00:23:04.370
Ah, the flowers are opening.

00:22:58.050 --> 00:23:04.370
嗚呼　花開け

00:22:58.050 --> 00:23:04.370
aa　hana hirake

00:23:04.560 --> 00:23:06.920
No, no, no, no.

00:23:04.560 --> 00:23:06.920
ダメダメダメダメ

00:23:04.560 --> 00:23:06.920
dame dame dame dame

00:23:05.490 --> 00:23:08.100
In the next episode of Sumomomo Momomo...

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:09.390
Do it, do it, do it.

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:09.390
してしてして

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:09.390
shite shite shite

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:10.610
It's the story about "together with fate".

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:13.150
Koushi-dono has "chinpu no purotaion"!

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:13.350
No, no, no, no.

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:13.350
ダメダメダメダメ

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:13.350
dame dame dame dame

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:14.570
No, it's "chinu no putomain"...

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.890
It's going to burst.

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.890
張り裂けそうなの

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.890
harisake sou nano

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:15.540
The poison...

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:17.330
Koushi-dono!!

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.940
Let's dance the dance.

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.940
踊り踊ろう

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.940
odori odorou
